Four PSDs written by Photoshop 26.10.0, each holding a smart-object record
(PlLd / SoLd), committed as Photoshop wrote them:

p8_smart_object.psd: an 8-bit embedded smart object.
p8_smart_filter.psd: the same, with a Gaussian Blur smart filter.
t7_C16.psd: a 16-bit smart object.
f3_SRC16.psd: a 16-bit smart object whose contents are 32-bit.

core/tests/psd_smart_object_pixels.rs reads them: each imports as its layer
pixels, with the discarded record reported as a loss. The oracle is each
file's own merged composite, which Photoshop rendered.
